{'symbol': 'FOX', 'date': '2021-06-17 16:05:00', 'title': 'FOX CORPORATION ANNOUNCES $2 BILLION INCREMENTAL STOCK REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES, JUNE 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FOX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX) (THE "COMPANY" OR "FOX") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE "BOARD") HAS AUTHORIZED INCREMENTAL STOCK REPURCHASES OF UP TO AN ADDITIONAL $2\xa0BILLION OF THE COMPANY\'S CLASS\xa0A COMMON STOCK AND CLASS\xa0B COMMON STOCK. WITH THIS INCREASE, THE COMPANY\'S TOTAL STOCK REPURCHASE AUTHORIZATION IS NOW $4 BILLION OF WHICH MORE THAN $1.56 BILLION HAS BEEN COMPLETED TO DATE.'}